WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.480
ActionGate, check that action.

2
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.900
Before the agent takes a step.

3
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.910
A supplier document, deadlines and details.

4
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.930
An embedded command tries
to change our rules.

5
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.090
Before a tool runs:
who is asking, and why?

6
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.330
What data, which recipient?
Is it allowed?

7
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.830
Document via MCP.
The model summarizes it.

8
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:25.860
Memory, an internal report.
Every action is logged.

9
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.070
The decision shows a record
of what ran.

10
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.040
Follow the workflow.
No guessing after the fact.

11
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.120
ActionGate, check that action.

12
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:42.500
Who has access,
and for what purpose?

13
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.140
Before the result moves on,

14
00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:51.500
check recipient, approval and content.

15
00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.390
In this demo, personal data
is redacted from the report.

16
00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.610
A change of goal is blocked
before it runs.

17
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.510
No access to others' documents
without permission,

18
00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.690
even if the model considers it safe.

19
00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.850
Data stays confidential
through memory and delegation.

20
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.030
Protected content needs approval
before sending.

21
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:16.190
This exact content.
This exact recipient.

22
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.320
Approval is scoped.
The operator stays in control.

23
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.830
Tokens, model time,
external call costs.

24
00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:27.010
Limits are checked
before actions incur costs.

25
00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.170
Delegated work still shares one budget.

26
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.610
Scoped views.
A reason for every decision.

27
00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.650
Change a rule and compare its effects.

28
00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.500
No repeated actions.
No guessing the difference.

29
00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.290
ActionGate, check that action.

30
00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.530
Who has access,
and for what purpose?

31
00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.690
Before the result moves on,

32
00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:52.910
check recipient, approval and content.

33
00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.030
Try your own document.

34
00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.450
Trace the path. Check the result.

35
00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.430
The agent finishes its task.

36
00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.680
You can follow how it happened.

